    "Imam Ja'far al-Sadiq (a.s.): “Truly God has twelve thousand worlds, each world greater than the seven heavens and the seven earths; not one of those worlds knows that God has any world besides them.” (al-Khisal; al-Majlisi, Bihar al-Anwar, vol. 54)",
